{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DODGEBRAWL</strong>\u00a0is a multiplayer PvP dodgeball-themed FPS, full of maps, game modes, equipment, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the nostalgic fun of everyone's favorite gym class activity, with some added wackiness and fun elements that wouldn't work in a real basketball court! Ever wanted to use a beach ball as a dodgeball? What about a boomerang, or a baseball, or... a land mine?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodgebrawl is more than just a digital version of the classic sport, it's an experience with the community. Play a pickup game with a few of your friends, or join a public game with a bunch of players!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933900?t=1769014356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933900/ab7cef452fbc80135d64c82f39da782e6e237f8c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769014356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933900/3707f8acc18c968155288559dd2d6808b77c3eb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769014356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933900/3707f8acc18c968155288559dd2d6808b77c3eb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769014356","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DODGEBRAWL</strong>\u00a0is a multiplayer PvP dodgeball-themed FPS, full of maps, game modes, equipment, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the nostalgic fun of everyone's favorit